
<view class="safe-area">
  <view class="bg-confetti"></view>
  <view class="page-header">
    <button class="back-btn" bindtap="back">‹</button>
    <text class="page-title">界面 9/10 · 游戏进行中</text>
    <view class="header-actions"><text>•••</text><text>◉</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="play-room glass-card">
    <view>
      <view class="room-title">{{game.name}}</view>
      <view class="round-line">第 {{round}} 轮 / 共 {{settings.rounds}} 轮</view>
    </view>
    <view class="joined">👥 {{players.length}}/{{room.maxPlayers}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="cream-card play-card">
    <view class="label">你的秘密情境</view>
    <view class="scenario-big">{{myRole.prompt}}</view>
    <view class="muted center">请根据情境选择或演唱一两句歌曲，帮助大家推理。</view>

    <view class="recommend-title">🎵 为你推荐的歌曲</view>
    <view class="songs">
      <block wx:for="{{songs}}" wx:key="name">
        <view class="song-chip">
          <text class="song-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="singer">{{item.singer}}</text>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="assist-grid">
      <button bindtap="shuffle">🔀 随机换一组</button>
      <button>☰ 仅显示歌名</button>
      <button>▶ 播放副歌</button>
      <button>▣ 查看歌词提示</button>
    </view>

    <view class="lyric-box">
      <view class="lyric-title">歌词提示（仅供参考）</view>
      <view class="lyric-text">{{lyricHint}}</view>
      <view class="lyric-note">仅展示极短片段，辅助生成灵感；演唱 1~2 句即可。</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="player-progress glass-card">
    <block wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="progress-item {{item.id===currentPlayerId?'active':''}}">
        <view class="avatar-dot">{{item.avatar}}</view>
        <text>{{index+1}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="button-row">
    <button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="goVote">进入投票</button>
    <button class="primary-btn flex" bindtap="endGame">结束并公开身份</button>
  </view>
</view>
